      "name": "Dark Multi-Column Footer",
      "description": "A professional dark-themed footer with 4 columns for large websites",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .ft2-wrap{background:#0f172a;padding:80px 20px 30px;font-family:sans-serif;color:#fff;}\n                          .ft2-inner{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:40px;margin-bottom:60px;}\n                          .ft2-brand{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:20px;display:inline-block;}\n                          .ft2-desc{color:#94a3b8;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 20px;max-width:300px;}\n                          .ft2-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 20px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;}\n                          .ft2-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;}\n                          .ft2-list a{color:#94a3b8;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;transition:color 0.3s;}\n                          .ft2-list a:hover{color:#38bdf8;}\n                          .ft2-bottom{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding-top:30px;border-top:1px solid #1e293b;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}\n                          .ft2-copy{color:#64748b;font-size:14px;}\n                          .ft2-legal{display:flex;gap:20px;}\n                          .ft2-legal a{color:#64748b;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;transition:color 0.3s;}\n                          .ft2-legal a:hover{color:#fff;}\n                          @media(max-width:900px){.ft2-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}\n                          @media(max-width:500px){.ft2-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .ft2-bottom{flex-direction:column;gap:15px;text-align:center;}}\n                        </style>\n                        <footer class=\"ft2-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"ft2-inner\">\n                            <div>\n                              <div class=\"ft2-brand\">DarkUI.</div>\n                              <p class=\"ft2-desc\">Building the next generation of digital experiences. Designed with precision and passion.</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                              <h4 class=\"ft2-title\">Product</h4>\n                              <ul class=\"ft2-list\">\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">Overview</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">Features</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">Solutions</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">Releases</a></li>\n                              </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                              <h4 class=\"ft2-title\">Company</h4>\n                              <ul class=\"ft2-list\">\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">About Us</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">Careers</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">Press</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">Contact</a></li>\n                              </ul>\n                            </div>\n                            <div>\n                              <h4 class=\"ft2-title\">Resources</h4>\n                              <ul class=\"ft2-list\">\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">Blog</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">Newsletter</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">Events</a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"#\">Help Center</a></li>\n                              </ul>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"ft2-bottom\">\n                            <div class=\"ft2-copy\">&copy; 2026 DarkUI. All rights reserved.</div>\n                            <div class=\"ft2-legal\">\n                              <a href=\"#\">Terms</a>\n                              <a href=\"#\">Privacy</a>\n                              <a href=\"#\">Cookies</a>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </footer>\n                    "
    },
